    {
      "example": "ISSUE_REPORT",
      "help_en": "The feedback type. Valid values:\n\nISSUE_REPORT: issue report.\nCANCEL_CHAT: task cancellation.\nLIKE: like.\nDISLIKE: dislike",
      "help_zh": "反馈类型：\n\nISSUE_REPORT 问题上报\nCANCEL_CHAT 任务取消\nLIKE 点赞\nDISLIKE 点踩",
