      "help_en": "The feedback target. Valid values:\n\nSESSION: session (used for issue reports).\nCHAT: chat (used for task cancellation).\nREPORT: report.\nPLAN: execution plan",
      "help_zh": "反馈目标：\n\nSESSION 会话（用于问题上报）\nCHAT （用于任务取消）\nREPORT 报告\nPLAN 执行计划",
