      "raw_name": "TargetId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The like value. This parameter is used only for like and dislike scenarios. Do not pass this parameter for other scenarios. Valid values:\n\n1: like.\n-1: dislike",
      "help_zh": "点赞值（点赞点踩场景下使用，其他场景不传）：\n\n1 点赞\n-1 点踩",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "like_value",
      "options": [
        "--like-value"
      ],
      "raw_name": "LikeValue",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\"feedback_type\":\"PRODUCT_SUGGESTION\",\"user_feedback\": \"test\",\"email\":\"yourname@example.com\",\"is_authorized\":\"Y\"}",
      "help_en": "The feedback content. You can directly enter the feedback content, or pass a JSON string for the issue report scenario as shown in the example. The feedback_type field corresponds to the issue type, user_feedback corresponds to the issue description, email corresponds to the contact email address, and is_authorized indicates whether to authorize log access for troubleshooting.\n\nfeedback_type issue types. Valid values:\n\nANALYSIS_RESULT_INACCURATE: Inaccurate analysis result.\nRUNTIME_ERROR: Runtime error.\nREPORT_EXCEPTION: Report exception.\nSLOW_RESPONSE: Slow response.\nPRODUCT_SUGGESTION: Product suggestion.\nOTHER: Other",
      "help_zh": "反馈的内容，可以直接输入反馈的内容；也可以传入示例中问题上报场景下的 jsonString，feedback_type 字段对应 问题类型，user_feedback 对应中的 问题描述，email 对应 联系邮箱，is_authorized 授权查看日志排查问题。\n\nfeedback_type 问题类型：\n\nANALYSIS_RESULT_INACCURATE  分析结果不准确\nRUNTIME_ERROR   运行报错\nREPORT_EXCEPTION  报告异常\nSLOW_RESPONSE  响应速度慢\nPRODUCT_SUGGESTION   产品建议\nOTHER   其他",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "feedback_content",
      "options": [
        "--feedback-content"
      ],
      "raw_name": "FeedbackContent",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
